00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:56.000
SURA 39 أَلَا لِلَّهِ ٱلدِّينُ ٱلْخَالِصُ devotion and worship belong to God alone.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:14.000
Some of you probably saw this bombshell where there is announcement

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:20.000
