00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:55.000
Ignorance, because the Quran teaches us that a messenger of God

00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:01.000
is not necessarily better than anyone else in the congregation.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:12.000
In SURA 18, from verses 60 to verse 82, we see that God picked out one of the biggest messengers,

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:22.000
Moses, one that God said I made you for myself. (20:41) وَٱصْطَنَعْتُكَ لِنَفْسِى I made you for Me.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:30.000
And in other place, God said (20:39) لِتُصْنَعَ عَلَىٰ عَيْنِىٓ I had you made before My eyes.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:39.000
And we see in those verses that God sent Moses to one of our servants, whom we bestowed,

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.000
we gave mercy and knowledge.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.000
And Moses proved to be a lousy student.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:51.000
