00:015:10.000 --> 00:015:16.000
The Quran repeats they said Oh, he just wants to be better than we are. He wants to be a leader.

00:015:16.000 --> 00:015:22.000
And this is emphasized throughout the Quran.

00:015:22.000 --> 00:015:30.000
You're gonna find some verses in here. And there is in SURA 17, verse 94, it says what

00:015:30.000 --> 00:015:36.000
