00:016:20.000 --> 00:016:31.000
So, it's a tremendous test to accept somebody who says he is a messenger of God.

00:016:31.000 --> 00:016:35.000
There's an ego here. We're required to kill the ego.

00:016:35.000 --> 00:016:40.000
And this applies to all of us. One of the requirements in the Quran.

00:016:40.000 --> 00:016:47.000
The egotistic person will resent anything like this and will be deprived.

00:016:47.000 --> 00:016:53.000
